35
00:00:49,333 --> 00:00:49,633
Hmph!

36
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,766
Tiga ribu orang mengepung desaku!

37
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,400
Pertempuran defensif ini kulakukan—

38
00:00:54,066 --> 00:00:54,966
