Jaga pertama, jaga kedua, jaga ketiga

146
00:04:09,166 --> 00:04:10,500
Bagaimana keadaan Longcheng sekarang?

147
00:04:10,533 --> 00:04:11,800
Di sana ada temanku.

148
00:04:11,866 --> 00:04:12,700
Dan juga suamiku—

149
00:04:12,733 --> 00:04:13,400
