175
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,033
Tenang!

176
00:06:02,066 --> 00:06:03,366
Semua, tenang!

177
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:04,666
Semua pasukan!

178
00:06:05,133 --> 00:06:05,866
Serang!

179
00:06:23,866 --> 00:06:24,866
Pemanah mundur!

180
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,000
Pasukan berkuda melindungi barisan belakang!

181
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:27,900
Seluruh pasukan mundur ke Longcheng!

182
00:06:38,900 --> 00:06:39,966
Longcheng masih bertempur!

183
00:06:40,133 --> 00:06:41,866
Sekarang bukan waktunya berhenti untuk berkabung!

184
00:06:41,933 --> 00:06:42,800
Terus maju!

185
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,766
Serangan besar!

186
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:02,966
Beritahu semua gerbang,

187
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,766
